Z||000010||rogergarrison||07-15-2001||06:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jaei Sun:<BR><B>Last weekend I got pulled over on University and was cited "Obstructed Front Plate".   you can still see the plate and read it head on.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I got the same hastle once. I went straight to the Mayors office and sat down demanding to see him. Only waited a 1/2 hour. He asked me the problem. I showed him my car parked rite in front of his window. "Can you read my licence plate?" he said yes. and I told him I just got a ticket for it. He called the police chief in to ask what the problem was. His answer was it wasnt in the place on car its supposed to be. I just said "sooooo, you can see it from front cant you?" They threw out the ticket. I was pissed and wasnt going to stand for the BS. I never been stopped in that city (Gahanna) again.<P>||||reg||1
